    "preamble": "Partha Manna vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 8 October, 2021 In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Blapl No.5405 of 2021 Partha Manna .... Petitioner Mr. Jagannath Pattnaik, Senior Advocate along with Mr. B. S. Rayaguru, Advocate -versus- State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Ms. S. Patnaik, Aga Coram: The Chief Justice Order",
